  "tip": "<p>When a question targets a <i>continuous</i> migration into Cloud SQL for PostgreSQL, look for prerequisites that enable logical replication such as <i>pglogical</i> on the source and <i>primary keys</i> on every table, and eliminate options that imply downtime or weakened integrity.</p>",
